<noinclude>Infrastructure for wiki-based poll
== Usage==
<code><nowiki>{{#widget:</nowiki>{{PAGENAME}}<nowiki>|options=x,y,z|colors=c1,c2,c3...|disabled=reason}}</nowiki></code>

== options ==

;options
:optional comma separated list of options defining the poll that immediately follows the widget:

{|class="prettytable"
| '''voters'''
| show the number of users that answered this question
|-
|'''count'''
|rowspan="2"| display number<br />'''or'''<br />percentage for each response
|-
|'''percent'''
|-
|'''after'''
|rowspan="2"|only display results after voting (implies never shown to users that are not logged in, since they can't vote)<br />'''or'''<br/>only to users that have voted and to users that are not logged in
|-
|'''anon'''
|-
|'''bars'''
|show color bar graph
|-
|'''disabled'''
|do not accept new votes
|}

;bars
: optional comma separated list of colors that will be used cyclically for barchart colors, over-riding built-in colors  (automatically sets '''bars''' option)
;disabled
: optional text string explaining that votes are no longer solicited

